q-0Q7kNvwHceoQK&_nc_oc=AdogaGC4IwrgtFgPLClfHJ0V6FfpC8BQTeCL1jSOwmOtBv1YvmRDczF0djEo3B1J2vo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4YTnkGnSfP_zzMf6ehR9cCbIV6vZsIcibjyBSpfHg9Ew&oe=6A1AF6F4"}, "display_name": "Tube Time", "keywords": ["Tubing", "Relaxation", "Scenery", "Nature", "Rivers"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Hop in, Float On, and Chill!\n\nGrab your tube and drift into a serene VR escape\u2014ride sun-kissed rivers, explore stunning canyons, and vibe with friends as the sky shifts around you in real-time. \n\nThis is Tube Time.\n{1058100459587220}\n\n\ud83d\udea3 Float With Friends\nSquad up or go solo\u2014it\u2019s your river, your adventure! Laugh, chat, and explore in a one-of-a-kind social VR experience.\n{2139569103165849}\n\n\ud83c\udf05 Every Ride is a New Adventure\nFrom golden sunrises to misty moonlit drifts, dynamic weather and a day-night cycle keep things fresh every time you float.\n{3073192249501392}\n\n\ud83d\udca6 Dive In Today!\nGrab your tube and make a splash\u2014Tube Time is waiting!\n\n\n", "short_description": "Hop in and float through beautiful landscapes with friends! I\u2019ve created Tube Time as a chill escape where you can relax, enjoy stunning scenery, and have fun together. Every session feels fresh with changing weather and day/night cycles.\n\nI\u2019m still hard at work building Tube Time and would love your feedback. Reach out on Discord or email me. Thanks for your support!\n\nMatt\nmattc@zippyelf.com\nwww.zippyelf.com"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zippyelf.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zippy Elf", "support_website_url": "http://www.zippyelf.com/", "website_url": "http://www.zippyelf.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": 